    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Get ready for a slimy adventure in 'Turf Wars: A Snail Escape'! As a colorful snail hero, you'll need to navigate through dangerous areas, battle difficult bosses, and expand your turf before your enemies do. This isn't just any garden - it's a roguelike adventure bursting with upgrades. So, are you ready to out-slime your foes and head out on this epic snail-paced adventure? (just kidding, it's fast!\ud83d\udc0c)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/148057b3244043d3075e1098e8ba2151.avif?t=1701360001\" /></div><br>The garden is a dangerous place, so follow these tips:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Remain on your turf<br></li><li>Plan your moves and make sure you got an escape route<br></li><li>Pick weapons and upgrades strategically</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/75e344f022d0ee2840b1ca6b7b63ad44.poster.avif?t=1701360001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/75e344f022d0ee2840b1ca6b7b63ad44.webm?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/75e344f022d0ee2840b1ca6b7b63ad44.mp4?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Using the right slime type will be the difference between easily sliding down the garden or drying out.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grey - Unclaimed territory<br></li><li>Yellow - Fast &amp; recharges weapons<br></li><li>Green - Ultrafast!<br></li><li>Red - Ultraslow!<br></li><li>Black - Hurts... a lot</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/e3ffcf8fc23cb53dce006a5ef201fe93.poster.avif?t=1701360001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/e3ffcf8fc23cb53dce006a5ef201fe93.webm?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/e3ffcf8fc23cb53dce006a5ef201fe93.mp4?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A wild variety of powerful weapons and tools awaits. Equip up to 4 out of the 20 unique items available, try out different slime types, and unlock over 100 upgrades. Earn coins for in-run upgrades or gather gems to unlock permanent enhancements. Prepare for endless possibilities where you need to constantly adapt your strategy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/7b96465e1fe5adb2e0c8913413a7d156.avif?t=1701360001\" /></div><br><br>We strive to offer an inclusive gaming experience for all players, so you can always turn on the dedicated colorblind mode that utilizes shapes instead of colors. You can also navigate the garden with either controller or keyboard, both with remapping and autofire options, offering flexibility and freedom in how you play. More inexperienced snails can also turn down the heat a bit with extra difficulty settings.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Gear up and jump into the Turf Wars - the battle awaits!",
    "about_the_game": "Get ready for a slimy adventure in 'Turf Wars: A Snail Escape'! As a colorful snail hero, you'll need to navigate through dangerous areas, battle difficult bosses, and expand your turf before your enemies do. This isn't just any garden - it's a roguelike adventure bursting with upgrades. So, are you ready to out-slime your foes and head out on this epic snail-paced adventure? (just kidding, it's fast!\ud83d\udc0c)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/148057b3244043d3075e1098e8ba2151.avif?t=1701360001\" /></div><br>The garden is a dangerous place, so follow these tips:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Remain on your turf<br></li><li>Plan your moves and make sure you got an escape route<br></li><li>Pick weapons and upgrades strategically</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/75e344f022d0ee2840b1ca6b7b63ad44.poster.avif?t=1701360001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/75e344f022d0ee2840b1ca6b7b63ad44.webm?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/75e344f022d0ee2840b1ca6b7b63ad44.mp4?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Using the right slime type will be the difference between easily sliding down the garden or drying out.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grey - Unclaimed territory<br></li><li>Yellow - Fast &amp; recharges weapons<br></li><li>Green - Ultrafast!<br></li><li>Red - Ultraslow!<br></li><li>Black - Hurts... a lot</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/e3ffcf8fc23cb53dce006a5ef201fe93.poster.avif?t=1701360001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/e3ffcf8fc23cb53dce006a5ef201fe93.webm?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/e3ffcf8fc23cb53dce006a5ef201fe93.mp4?t=1701360001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A wild variety of powerful weapons and tools awaits. Equip up to 4 out of the 20 unique items available, try out different slime types, and unlock over 100 upgrades. Earn coins for in-run upgrades or gather gems to unlock permanent enhancements. Prepare for endless possibilities where you need to constantly adapt your strategy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058360/extras/7b96465e1fe5adb2e0c8913413a7d156.avif?t=1701360001\" /></div><br><br>We strive to offer an inclusive gaming experience for all players, so you can always turn on the dedicated colorblind mode that utilizes shapes instead of colors. You can also navigate the garden with either controller or keyboard, both with remapping and autofire options, offering flexibility and freedom in how you play. More inexperienced snails can also turn down the heat a bit with extra difficulty settings.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Gear up and jump into the Turf Wars - the battle awaits!",
    "short_description": "Strap on your shell and dive antenna-first into a thrilling action roguelike. Spread slime, snag upgrades, and splat bugs. You only have one mission: escape the garden or dry trying...",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA unique and maddeningly challenging roguelike game that will keep you engaged for hours on end. I know I said \u201cjust one more run\u201d to myself more than a few times out of pure spite!\u201d<br>Game Review Monster<br><br>\u201cA fun and fresh take on the Twin Stick Shooter genre\u201d<br>Mr. Delightful<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s a lot of fun and considering you\u2019re a snail it\u2019s a surprisingly fast paced game. There\u2019s a nice variety of weapons/upgrades to unlock and the slime mechanics work really well\u201d<br>AlphaBetaGamer<br>",
